---
// src/pages/index.astro
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>TradeGuard - Hardcore Risk Control for Forex & Binary Options</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen font-sans selection:bg-sky-500 selection:text-white">
    
    <!-- 1. Navigation Menu -->
    <nav class="flex justify-between items-center p-6 border-b border-slate-800 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-xl font-bold text-sky-400 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>🛡️</span> TradeGuard <span class="text-xs bg-sky-950 text-sky-400 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-sky-800">PRO</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-6 text-sm">
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Features</a>
        <a href="#architecture" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Dual-Engine</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#portal" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">User Portal</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-sky-400 transition">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <a href="#pricing" class="bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition">
        Get License
      </a>
    </nav>

    <!-- 2. Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-20 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="inline-block bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700 mb-6">
        🚀 Next-Gen Anti-Revenge Trading Technology
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Eliminate Emotional Trading.<br/><span class="text-sky-400">Locked-in Discipline You Can't Override.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        TradeGuard combines a lightweight Chrome Manifest V3 Extension with a hardened Windows Desktop Enforcement Agent to strictly control your trading risks and stop tilt-trading in real time.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="#pricing" class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg shadow-lg transition">
          🔒 Lock Your Discipline Now
        </a>
        <a href="#architecture" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg border border-slate-700 transition">
          How It Works
        </a>
      </div>
      <!-- Badges -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-6 mt-12 text-xs text-slate-500">
        <span>⚡ MV3 Web Socket Interceptor</span>
        <span>🛡️ Windows Policy Enforcement</span>
        <span>🐕 Active Process Watchdog</span>
        <span>💳 USDT / Crypto Instant Auto-Key</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Dual-Engine Architecture Section -->
    <section id="architecture" class="py-16 bg-slate-800/40 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4">Dual-Engine Anti-Tilt Architecture</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Traditional proxies fail and VPNs get turned off. TradeGuard operates at both the browser DOM layer and Windows system level.</p>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          <!-- Engine 1 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-sky-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Frontend Sensor</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🌐</span> Chrome Extension (MV3)
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Real-Time Packet Tapping:</strong> Intercepts raw WebSocket & HTTP trade execution packets directly in browser memory.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Live HUD Overlay:</strong> Injects real-time Health Bar (HP) widgets and account metrics right onto Pocket Option & brokers.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-sky-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Policy Force-Locked:</strong> Enforced via Windows Group Policy. Users cannot disable, remove, or incognito-bypass the extension.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Engine 2 -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-red-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Backend Enforcer</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🖥️</span> Windows Desktop Agent
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Local IPC Server:</strong> Communicates via encrypted 127.0.0.1 WebSocket with zero external proxy overhead.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Tamper-Proof Watchdog:</strong> Active background guard prevents process termination via Task Manager, CMD, or PowerShell.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400">✓</span>
                <span><strong>Uncompromising Countdown:</strong> Hard-coded 24h+ lockout countdown timer with zero emergency reset buttons.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Pricing Section -->
    <section id="pricing" class="py-20">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4">Protect Your Capital Today</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400">One emotional trade can cost hundreds. Invest in automatic discipline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <!-- Monthly -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">1-Month Pass</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6">Ideal for testing out automated discipline.</p>
              <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6">$19 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">/ mo</span></div>
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                <li>✓ Full MV3 Extension Protection</li>
                <li>✓ Windows Desktop Watchdog</li>
                <li>✓ 1 License Key (1 Active PC)</li>
                <li>✓ Self-Service HWID Reset</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="YOUR_CRYPTO_CHECKOUT_URL_1M" class="w-full bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white text-center font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition block">
              Pay with USDT / Crypto
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Annual (Featured) -->
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-800 to-slate-900 p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-sky-500 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between relative">
            <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-sky-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide">
              Most Popular
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-sky-400">1-Year Pass</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6">Long-term consistency & maximum savings.</p>
              <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6">$99 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400">/ yr</span></div>
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                <li>✓ Everything in Monthly</li>
                <li>✓ Priority Auto-Updates</li>
                <li>✓ Advanced Risk HUD Customization</li>
                <li>✓ 2 Free HWID Resets / Month</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="YOUR_CRYPTO_CHECKOUT_URL_1Y" class="w-full bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-600 text-white text-center font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition block">
              Pay with USDT / Crypto
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Lifetime -->
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Lifetime Freedom</h3>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-6">Pay once, protected for life.</p>
              <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6">$199 <span class="text-sm font-normal text-slate-400 font-bold">LIFETIME</span></div>
              <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8">
                <li>✓ Permanent License & Updates</li>
                <li>✓ All Future Features & Brokers</li>
                <li>✓ VIP Discord / Telegram Support</li>
                <li>✓ Unlimited Self-Service HWID Resets</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <a href="YOUR_CRYPTO_CHECKOUT_URL_LT" class="w-full bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white text-center font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition block">
              Pay with USDT / Crypto
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. User Self-Service Portal Section -->
    <section id="portal" class="py-16 bg-slate-800/50 border-t border-b border-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Buyer Self-Service Portal</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mb-10">Lost your key? Switched to a new PC? Manage your license instantly with zero waiting for support.</p>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left">
          <!-- Reset HWID -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Reset PC Binding (HWID)</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-4">Upgraded your PC or reinstalled Windows? Unbind your old computer Hardware ID instantly.</p>
            <a href="/portal/reset-hwid" class="text-sky-400 text-sm font-bold hover:underline inline-block">
              Open HWID Reset Portal →
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- Retrieve Key -->
          <div class="bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div class="text-xl mb-2">🔍</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Retrieve Key via TxHash</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mb-4">Made a typo in your email during crypto checkout? Query your license key using your Blockchain TxHash.</p>
            <a href="/portal/lookup-key" class="text-sky-400 text-sm font-bold hover:underline inline-block">
              Lookup Key by TxHash →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. FAQ Section -->
    <section id="faq" class="py-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-10">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: How do I receive my License Key after Crypto payment?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Once your USDT / USDC transaction gets confirmed on the blockchain, the License Key will instantly render on the checkout success screen AND be emailed to you via Resend transactional mail.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: Can I kill TradeGuard via Windows Task Manager if I want to trade?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">No. TradeGuard incorporates a background Watchdog process and Windows Policy locks. Once a risk lock is triggered, the agent actively resists forced termination until the timer expires.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800 p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Q: Will this slow down my PC or conflict with my VPN?</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Not at all. TradeGuard no longer uses system-wide proxy drivers or CA certificates. It communicates strictly via local 127.0.0.1 IPC, leaving your regular VPNs and network traffic completely untouched.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-800 space-y-2">
      <p>© 2026 TradeGuard Project. Hardcore discipline for smart traders.</p>
      <p class="space-x-4">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-sky-400 transition underline">Privacy Policy</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Disclaimer: TradeGuard is an independent risk control utility and is not affiliated with Pocket Option.</span>
      </p>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>